{
 "encounter_id": "00842",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mm. It's the winter. I get low. Every year. It's started again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been this time?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since October. Six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's different from your normal self?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No energy. I sleep more. Eat more. Don't want to see anyone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's your concentration, at work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Poor. I read the same page three times."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any thoughts that life's not worth living?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And do you ever feel the opposite, very high, unable to sleep, full of ideas?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Never."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sertraline, 100 mg, maybe? Once a day. And vitamin D, 1000 units."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it 100 or 50, do you think?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I believe 100. The chemist knows."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll check on the record. Any conditions, apart from the winter lows?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Depression, years ago. And migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Is there anything in your life that's changed? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Not really. Just the dark mornings. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you get outdoors at lunchtime? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I work in an office. I leave in the dark, and come home in the dark. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness, or chest tightness, with the low mood?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing physical."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What you describe, low mood every autumn and winter, with oversleeping and overeating, lifting in spring, fits seasonal affective disorder."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that a real thing? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is, and it's common. It's linked to less daylight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What can I do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Get outdoors for half an hour at lunchtime, even if it's cloudy, and keep a regular sleep routine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I could do that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A light box, a bright light you sit in front of for thirty minutes each morning, has good evidence."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can I buy one? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, look for one with 10,000 lux. And keep taking the sertraline. I'd like to arrange a blood test, to check your thyroid and vitamin D, as these can add to low mood."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you in four weeks, to see how you're doing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thanks. ~"
  }
 ],
